<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are now conducting airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders, while Haitian police raids in Port-au-Prince have eliminated suspected gang members. A market near the capital was attacked, leaving ten dead and seven injured, and a separate attack killed 47 civilians, prompting a UN condemnation and EU sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. Bukele has disclosed details on the deaths of El Salvador troops operating in Haiti. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQU3RheHgwdFB4cXN6cDk0SEdPZzdwOUtwV212a29zdWdycDd4YkxETUI1ZTNpdFRkeElsRGNmRGZvcHh2N285LTRMSVFkbmVJRmtsaVpkR2ZLT3NzU0xObW9qYmlHYmwyOTYyLU42MUlpSkJkT1Bwb3dUSlR3OGY5U1BKQ2FrSmFmcHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQTFhiLU5QQWJrcTVfSjdBVEZQUWpNWVQ5S0F5SFJCeFFhc05pdEl1dExoWjlZem5pTmhvQ1YyRWlQeGdsSE9mU0J2dFpFNTlPdnZQT3RJdlNUdFk2VWhQUnQ5X2s0bl8xTkpkeFRaWnJtQkFjY0R3MWc3amdQVkI1Wi1zYVRNSW1KSFJsNllyczNtRUc2bFg5RjRHU1I3c1BXcXV1VDZrS0RjQmZPNGZCYVUzcGdYdFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Goshen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNMzFrdGhDdDIwdlVJMF9qZlpnVk9ULWF3eWJhLWVjR05mUjQxZVhOUFlPcC1YZWlSbjM1dXR6ckJTekEtUDlCN2FfeElhdnp2dXRqLUlidjg5dkxoTzI2RTZiMnhzdC1iM2lPZ2kxcU1OV1lGQXR5ekZvd2NzYkxtcXZrVk9zNUJpME9yS000YXdyQWQwcmZUYmxPUVRsY0JpLXR0R3NWN3lhRUpxRUsxeG1B?oc=5&quot;&gt;LatinAmerican Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQWThMRy13Q1k4ZEVOeDdfeEZxRFc3Q2pLVldKN2NHdEp1N2xkQ0psRXg3TDZyb04tV1NtMXU0UGtqcDNySTFieW1xWTUwckZ6bjQzSzE4c1RRX0hlV0FYeDVUN3ZGNFc3bEZrTWl4OUxIcFJ0Mmh5b1l2MTVQd1Nram04Tnhldm92SDJ4RGNxZl8zLVNhYndBSmhsUHpHUmJOMlFZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;T